WEBVTT

00:07:29.196 --> 00:07:31.516
they speak very different languages,

00:07:31.556 --> 00:07:34.156
and a lot of bridging
is required between them.

00:07:34.916 --> 00:07:37.036
But this is the kind of work
we need to do,

00:07:37.076 --> 00:07:39.396
if we're going to start
rebalancing the equation

00:07:39.436 --> 00:07:42.276
between technology investment
and community investment.

00:07:43.076 --> 00:07:44.316
We, as the investor,

00:07:44.356 --> 00:07:48.436
often actually pay the nonprofit
to do this kind of work.

00:07:48.476 --> 00:07:51.276
We think this is a key part
of the equation:

00:07:51.276 --> 00:07:53.396
paying the nonprofit for their expertise,

00:07:53.396 --> 00:07:55.916
just as you would pay
an electrical contractor,

00:07:55.916 --> 00:07:57.676
a general contractor on a project,

00:07:57.676 --> 00:07:59.076
for their value.

00:07:59.116 --> 00:08:05.396
(Applause)